KINDS
[creature is a thing
dragon is a creature
wyrm is a dragon].

DEFINE
[a wyrm named ember
a wyrm named cinder
a door named north door
a key named brass key
a table named oak table
a guard named henry].

START
[ember is calm
cinder is calm
north door is locked
brass key is on the table
henry is calm].

WHEN
[player takes brass key
<then> (carry brass key].

IF
[north door is locked
<then> (unlock north door].

WHEN
[player attacks ember
<than> (damage ember
<then> (change ember to angry].

WHEN
[player attacks a creature
<then> (damage that creature
<then> (change that creature to angry].

WHEN
[player attacks a guard
<then> (damage that guard
<then> (change that guard to angry].
